{"id":"word:hebrew:H6908","type":"word","title":"קָבַץ","subtitle":"H6908 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to grasp , i.e. collect","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to קָבַץ (H6908) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 127 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"קָבַץ (qâbats) means to grasp , i.e. collect First listed occurrence: 1Chr 11 1."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"קָבַץ","transliteration":"qâbats","pronunciation":"kaw-bats'","strong":"H6908","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6908","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["וַ/יִּקָּבְצ֣וּ","וַ/יִּקְבֹּ֤ץ","וְ/קִבַּצְתִּ֣י","נִקְבְּצ֣וּ","וַ/יִּקְבֹּ֥ץ"],"morphs":[["HC/Vqw3ms",14],["HC/VNw3mp",9],["HC/Vpq1cs",9],["HVNp3cp",6],["HVprmsa",5],["HVpi1cs",5],["HC/Vtw3mp",4],["HVNv2mp",4],["HVtp3cp",3],["HC/Vqw3mp",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"to grasp , i.e. collect","usage":"assemble (selves), gather (bring) (together, selves together, up), heap, resort, × surely, take up.","full":"H6908. qabats קָבַץ 127 verb gather, collect (synonym אָסַף ) (Arabic grasp, seize ; Sabean קבץֿ harvest , in ׳דֿק , attribute of 'Attar, according to Fell ZMG liv (1900), 237 f. ; Ethiopic is fail, despair ; Late Hebrew קִבָּץ = Biblical Hebrew); — Qal Perfect 3masculine singular ׳ק 1Kin 20:1 ; Imperfect 3masculine singular יִקְבָּץֿ Psa 41:7 , וַיִּקְכֹּץ Gen 41:48 +, etc.; Imperative masculine singular קְבֹץ 1Kin 18:19 , masculine plural קִבְצוּ 1Sam 7:5 +; Infinitive construct suffix לְקָבְצִי Zeph 3:8 ; Participle active קֹבֵץ Ezek 22:19 ; Prov 13:11 ; passive plural קְכוּצִים Neh 5:16 ; &#8212; gather, collect: 1 with accusative of thing, grain Gen 41:35 , 48 (E), booty Deut 13:17 (+ אֶל location), money 2Chr 24:5 (+ מִן person), so Ezek 16:31 (Gr Toy Krae, reading לִקְבֹּץ from לְקַלֵּס , compare ᵑ6 ᵐ5 . Symm); accusative omitted קֹבֵץ Prov 13:11 one gathering by degrees; figurative יִק לוֺ׳לִבּוֺ אָֿוֶן Psa 41:7 his heart gathereth wickedness to itself. 2 usually with accusative of person gather, assemble , + ה locative 1Sam 7:5 ; 29:1 (for battle); + אֶל location 1Kin 18:20 ; Ezra 8:15 ; Est 2:3 ; + אֶל person 2Sam 3:21 ; Hab 2:5 (in figurative; || אָסַף ); + עַל (= אֶל ) person 1Kin 11:24 ; + אֶל person and location 18:19 ; 2Chr 32:6 ; + מִן local 23:2 , compare Ezra 7:28 ; accusative of person alone 1Kin 22:6 2Chr 18:5 ; 2Kin 10:18 ; Neh 7:5 (+ infinitive purpose), Joel 2:16 (|| אָסַף ), 2Chr 15:9 ; 24:5 ; 25:5 ; passive with שָׁם + עַל of work Neh 5:16 ; for ׳י s judgement Zeph 3:3 (|| אָסַף ), Ezek 22:20 compare 22:19 (+ אֶלאתּוֺךְ ; figurative of metals into furnace); specifically for war, battle, Judg 12:4 ; 1Sam 28:1 ; 2Sam 2:30 ; 1Kin 20:1 ; 2Kin 6:24 ; + לַצָּבָא 1Sam 28:1 ( 29:1 see above). Niph`al Perfect 3plural נִקְבְּצוּ Josh 10:6 +, etc.; Imperfect 2masculine singular תִּקָּבֵץ Ezek 29:5 ; 3 masculine plural וַיִּקָּֽבְצוּ 1Sam 7:6 +, etc.; Imperative masculine plural הִקָּֽבְצוּ Gen 49:2 +; Infinitive construct הִקָּבֵץ Ezra 10:7 +; Participle plural נִקְבָּצִים Jer 40:15 , suffix נִקְבָּצָיו Isa 56:8 ; &#8212; 1 intransitive assemble, gather 1Sam 25:1 ; Gen 49:2 ; Isa 45:20 ; 48:14 ; 49:18 ; 60:4 ; Joel 4:11; 2Chr 20:4 (+ infinitive purpose) 32:4 ; for war 1Sam 28:4 ; Josh 10:6 (with אֶל against ); with ה locative 1Sam 7:6 , accusative of location Ezra 10:7 , 9 ; 2Chr 15:10 ; with אֶל person unto Jer 40:15 ; 1Chr 13:2 ; Ezra 10:1 ; Neh 4:14 , compare 2Chr 13:7 ( עַל for אֶל ); אֶל person + ה locative 1Chr 11:1 ; with יַחְדָּו Hosea 2:2 ; Isa 43:9 (|| אָסַף ), Psa 102:23 ; of birds and beasts Isa 34:15 (with שָׁם ), Ezek 39:17 . 2 passive be gathered Isa 60:7 (of flocks, + ל person), Est 2:8 ( + אֶל location), 2:19 ; participle with suffix person Isa 56:8 ; Ezek 29:5 (|| אסף ) read תִּקָּבֵר Hi (not Sm) Co Berthol Toy Krae. Pi`el 51 Perfect 3 masculine singular suffix וְקִכֶּצְךָ Deut 30:3 consecutive, קִבְּצָם Micah 4:12 ; Psa 107:3 , קִכְּצָן Isa 34:16 ; 3 feminine singular קִבָּ֑צָה 1:7 , etc.; Imperfect יְקַבֵּץ 11:12 ; 40:11 , etc.; Imperative, masculine singular suffix קַכְּצֵנוּ 1Chr 16:35 ; Psa 106:47 ; Infinitive absolute קַכֵּץ Micah 2:12 ; construct קַכֵּץ Isa 66:13 etc.; Participle מְקַכֵּץ Nahum 3:18 +, etc.; — gather together: 1 usually of ׳י gathering his dispersed people (accusative), sometimes under figure of flock: Micah 2:12 + infinitive absolute (|| אָסַף ), 4:6 ; Zeph 3:19-20 , Jer 31:10 ; Zech 10:8 ; Isa 54:7 ; 56:8 a, compare also 40:11 ; with accusative + מִן local Deut 30:3-4 , Jer 23:5 ; 29:14 ; 31:8 ; 32:37 ; Ezek 11:17 6 t. Ezekiel + 37:21 ( מִסָּבִיב ), Isa 11:12 ; 43:5 ; Zech 10:10 ; Neh 1:9 Psalm + Neh 106:4, compare || 1Chr 16:35 ; Psa 107:3 ; accusative + עַל person Isa 56:8 b (compare Niph`al Participle ); = ( gather and) restrain Hosea 8:10 (with accusative alone); of ׳י gathering dispersed Egyptians, accusative + מִן local Ezek 29:13 ; gathering the nations (accusative) for judgment Micah 4:12 ; Isa 66:18 ; Joel 4:2; gathering lovers of Jerusalem (under figure of harlot) Ezek 16:37 (twice in verse) ( מִסָּבִיב + עַל person against ); gathering beasts into Edom Isa 34:16 . 2 men subject: תְּקַבְּרֵם מֹף תְּקַבְּצֵם מִצְרַיִם Hosea 9:6 (compare Ezek 29:5 Niph`al , above), Neh 13:11 ; with accusative of thing Micah 1:7 (+ מִן ), Isa 22:9 ; 62:9 ; Prov 28:8 ; מְקַבֵּץ אֵין none that gathereth Isa 13:14 (accusative omitted), Nahum 3:18 ( id. ), Jer 49:5 (followed by לַֹנּדֵד , compare ל 3 near the end). 3 perhaps ( gather and so) take away (= אָסַף 4 ), Nahum 2:11 ; Joel 2:6 see מָּארוּר . Pu`al Participle מְקֻבֶּצֶת Ezek 38:8 (with מִן ) of land (for people) of Israel Hithpa`el gather together (intransitive), be gathered together. Perfect 3plural הִתְקַבְּצוּ Judg 9:47 ; 1Sam 7:7 (+ ה locative); Imperfect 3masculine plural וַיִּתְקַבְּצוּ 8:2 ; 22:2 (+ אֶל person), ׳יִתְק Isa 44:11 ; for battle, war, Imperative masculine plural הַתְקַבְּצוּ Jer 49:14 ; Imperfect also Joshua 9: (with יִחְדָּו , + infinitive purpose), + אַחֲרֵי person 2Sam 2:25 .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 11 1","keyReferences":["1Chr 11 1","1Chr 13 2","1Chr 16 35","1Kgs 11 24","1Kgs 18 19","1Kgs 18 20","1Kgs 20 1","1Kgs 22 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":127,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 11 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּקָּבְצ֧וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/VNw3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 13 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/יִקָּבְצ֖וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/VNi3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 35","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":35,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/קַבְּצֵ֥/נוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpv2ms/Sp1cp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 24","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּקְבֹּ֤ץ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 18 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":18,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קְבֹ֥ץ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqv2ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 18 20","book":"1Kgs","chapter":18,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּקְבֹּ֥ץ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 20 1","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קָבַץ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 22 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":22,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּקְבֹּ֨ץ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 7 5","book":"1Sam","chapter":7,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִבְצ֥וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqv2mp"},{"reference":"1Sam 7 6","book":"1Sam","chapter":7,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּקָּבְצ֣וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/VNw3mp"},{"reference":"1Sam 7 7","book":"1Sam","chapter":7,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הִתְקַבְּצ֤וּ","sourc